# Manual outreach — tenants and vendors

When a landlord finishes setup (`completeOnboarding`), **no outbound SMS or email is sent automatically**. The same applies when residents or vendors are added after setup.

Managers send outreach when they are ready from **Residents** (welcome text) and **Vendors** (verification invite).

## Rule

| Event | Automatic outreach |
|---|---|
| Onboarding complete — resident with phone | **None** — send manually from Residents |
| Onboarding complete — vendor with phone/email | **None** — send manually from Vendors |
| Resident added after setup (with phone) | **None** — send manually from Residents |
| Phone added later to existing resident | **None** — send manually from Residents |
| Vendor added after setup (with phone/email) | **None** — send manually from vendor profile |
| Find External Vendor → Invite to verify | **Manual** — explicit `sendVendorInvite` via invite modal |

## Manual send paths

| Who | Where | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Resident / tenant | Residents list or resident profile | **Send Welcome Text** when status is not started; **Resend Welcome Text** when Action Required |
| Vendor | Vendor profile (and Find External Vendor flow) | **Send verification invite** |

## Tenant activation SMS retries

Retries apply **after** the manager sends the first welcome text (or resends).

| Attempt | When |
|---|---|
| 1 | When manager clicks Send Welcome Text or Resend Welcome Text |
| 2 | 24 hours after attempt 1, only if attempt 1 was a **delivery** failure |
| 3 | 72 hours after attempt 1 (final automatic retry) |
| After 3 failures | Stop; `activation_status = action_required`; notify landlord |

**Retry only** on delivery problems (invalid number, carrier/network/provider errors).

**Never auto-retry** when the resident replied STOP, already opted in / activated, or the phone number changed (landlord must update + **Resend Welcome Text**).

YES/START → `activated` (stop retries). STOP → `opted_out` (stop retries).

Landlord-facing statuses: Activated · Waiting for Resident · Delivery Failed (Retry X of 3) · Action Required · Not started (welcome not sent yet).

Manual **Resend Welcome Text** (Action Required) restarts the retry sequence after a successful send.

Cron: `check-tenant-activation-retries`. Attempts audited in `tenant_activation_attempts`.

## Requirements

- Pass each vendor’s `vendorId` when sending verification so form submit updates that roster profile.
- Mint a **unique** verification link per vendor invite.
- Best-effort delivery on manual send: surface errors in the UI; log graph events for the activity feed.
- Skip people with no usable contact info (disable Send buttons when phone/email missing).
- Follow the Ulo communication writing standard for all outbound copy.
- Idempotent: skip duplicate welcome while waiting (`activation_sms_sent_at` / `waiting`) unless landlord **Resend Welcome Text**.

## Where it lives

- Onboarding complete (no auto-send): `src/lib/onboarding/complete.ts` → `completeOnboarding`
- Manual tenant send: `src/api/tenantActivation.ts` → `sendTenantWelcomeSms` / `resendTenantActivationSms`
- Manual tenant UI: `TenantActivationManualActions` in Residents + resident profile
- Manual vendor invite: `src/api/vendorVerification.ts` → `sendVendorInvite`; UI on `AdminVendorDetailDashboard` + `InviteVendorModal`
- Tenant send + retries: `supabase/functions/_shared/sms/tenantActivation.ts` / `send-tenant-activation` / `check-tenant-activation-retries`
- Status UI: `src/lib/tenantActivationStatus.ts`

## Do not

- Auto-send welcome SMS on `completeOnboarding`, add resident, or first phone save
- Auto-send vendor verification on `completeOnboarding` or `VendorFormModal` save
- Block finishing setup on SMS/email failure (there is no automatic send at complete)
